(text "Default: ARM low, OE high, latches cleared before enabling. GPIO4/6/7 avoid boot UART pulls and GPIO1/2 glitches.\nMC14541B: AR=1 disables automatic reset; MR pulled high until ARM. MODE=0, QSEL=1, A=B=1.\n200k / 1nF C0G oscillator ~2174 Hz; 32768-count timeout ~15.07s. Release ARM immediately ends output.\nARM must be low >=10ms between commands. Hardware output requires both ARM and timer Q. No LED sensing."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid 89ba9a0a-0f76-52c3-88c1-652b1cef9b03))
